  "details": "1. Open Menu with Friends wing\n\n2. close menu\n\n3. wait some time until some people have left/joined your instance\n\n4. Open your menu again.\n\nYou will see a difference between Here/World Tab and Friends Wing (Happens in QM and MM). In my Screenshot you can see how the instance population dropped from 80 to 27\n\nScrolling instances out of view and back in fixes it.\n\nI assume the friends wing doesn't get updatet when the menu gets opened\n\nThis bug already exists for month but could never figure out how to reproduce it.",
